# Commit and worklog

When a lab phase or drill is finished, update `docs/worklog/week-1.md` in the same change and commit it. When a leave-hub slice from `rostr-leave-jev-report.pdf` is finished, update `docs/worklog/leave-hub.md` instead. Do not wait to be asked again. Do not put leave-hub time back into the lab log.

The worklog entry names what changed, the evidence, and the clock in Australia/Sydney. Keep the session table in step with that entry.

Do not commit `.env` files or secret values. Commit the docs, code, and screenshots that belong to that slice.

Leave the next phase unstarted until this commit exists.
